silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_26_circuit_imprint_tensor_sections_03_tensor_construction_concrete_anchor_1#iota_110 silm:hasLongDescription "The iota_110 is the specific functor iota_{1,1,0} : O_11 -> O_{physical, individual, classification}; instantiates the base square for the vet-clinic reading of Mittens. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'iota_110', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
